			description: [
				"&6&lWelcome to ATM Sky Lite.&r"
				""
				"You are standing on a scrap of dirt floating in an endless void. Below you: nothing. Around you: everything you will ever build."
				""
				"This book is one long climb, broken into &leight Ages&r. Each Age hands you the tools to reach the next - from your first sieve to a machine that ends the world you started on."
				""
				"&eClaim this quest for a starter kit and your first Sky Crate. Then read the panels around this one - they teach you everything the void won't.&r"
			]
