		{
			dependencies: ["30B0000000000001"]
			description: [
				"There is no mining here - so you &osieve&r for everything."
				""
				"1. Make a &eCobblestone Generator&r (flowing water meets lava)."
				"2. Craft a &eHammer&r and smash cobble into gravel, gravel into sand, sand into dust."
				"3. Craft a &eSieve&r and a &eMesh&r, then sift those for ores, seeds and treasure."
				""
				"Every ingot in this pack traces back to the sieve. As you upgrade your mesh (&7string &8→ &7flint &8→ &7iron &8→ &7diamond &8→ &7netherite&r) rarer drops appear. &aThe Sieve teaches all of it, step by step.&r"
			]
