		{
			dependencies: ["30B0000000000001"]
			description: [
				"&eJEI&r - the item list down the right of your inventory - is your best friend."
				""
				"- Hover an item and press &bR&r to see how to &lcraft&r it."
				"- Hover an item and press &bU&r to see what it is &lused&r for."
				"- Type in the search box to filter."
				""
				"Every machine from Ex Deorum, Mekanism, AE2, Powah and Ad Astra shows its recipe here. If a quest ever leaves you stuck, JEI has the answer."
