		{
			dependencies: ["30B0000000000001"]
			description: [
				"The whole book is one continuous climb. Complete an Age's &lcapstone&r to unlock the next - and the world itself is locked to match:"
				""
				"&2&lAct I · Foundations&r - everything up to your first real power."
				"&7The Sieve, The Kinetic Age, First Machines, Claim Your Island."
				""
				"&9&lAct II · Industry&r - the tech ladder you must climb to finish."
				"&7Powah, Solar Flux, Advanced Generators, Mekanism, Applied Energistics,"
				"&7The Space Program, The Aether."
				"&c&lAct III · Conquest&r - War in the Sky, The Void Signal, The Bestiary."
				"&5&lAct IV · Ascension&r - antimatter, and the Heart of the Sky."
				""
				"&8Green = done. Blue = available. &lThere is a real ending. Go take it.&r"
				""
				"&b&lAdditions&r &7- everything else. Not required to finish, all of it useful. Storage (drawers, backpacks, terminals - start this EARLY), &bSky Gadgets&7 (Cyclic conveniences) and &dEssence Farming&7 (Mystical Agriculture - grow diamonds, then nether stars, then godhood). Optional. Recommended. OP.&r"
			]
