		{
			dependencies: ["30B0000000000001"]
			description: [
				"No ore veins fall in the void, so &eSkyForge&r gives you bridge recipes. Craft an &eIndustrial Keystone&r, then in a crafting grid:"
				""
				"&7Keystone + 2 Sky Dust&r &8→&r Osmium &8(starts Mekanism)"
				"&7Keystone + 2 Sky Dust&r &8→&r Certus Quartz &8(starts AE2)"
				"&7Keystone + 2 Sky Dust&r &8→&r Uraninite &8(starts Powah)"
				"&7Keystone + 2 Sky Steel&r &8→&r Mekanism Steel"
				""
				"You can also &osieve&r your way to osmium and certus the slow way - the keystone is just the reliable shortcut. The Kinetic Age walks you through it."
			]
			icon: "skyforge:industrial_keystone"
