		{
			dependencies: ["30B0000000000001"]
			description: [
				"This pack does not ask nicely. The world is &lmechanically locked&r behind your progress."
				""
				"&6&lTIER LOCKS - one age buys the next&r"
				"&c⚔&r The &eMetallurgic Infuser&r is built around a &cCreate Precision Mechanism&r - no kinetics, no Mekanism."
				"&c⚔&r The &eAE2 Inscriber&r demands an &cAdvanced Control Circuit&r - the digital age waits for the electric one."
				"&a✔&r The &eNASA Workbench&r is plain steel. &aSpace needs no boss.&r"
				""
				"&6&lDIMENSION LOCKS - a planet buys a realm&r"
				"&c⚔&r The &eTwilight Forest&r ignores diamonds. Toss a &cDesh Ingot&r - and the portal stays dead until you've stood on the &cMoon&r."
				"&c⚔&r The &eUndergarden&r catalyst is cored with &cMars ostrum&r."
				"&c⚔&r The &eEverbright&r lighter is forged from &cVenus calorite&r."
				""
				"&6&lADVENTURE LOCKS - you cannot build your way past these&r"
				"&c✈&r The &eME Controller&r is cornered in &cDesh&r. No trip to the Moon, no network."
				"&c⚔&r &eAutocrafting&r - Molecular Assembler and Crafting CPU - is framed in &cMoon Desh&r."
				"&c⚔&r &eAdvanced Computers&r and every &eAdvanced Peripherals&r block need &cMars ostrum&r."
				"&c⚔&r The &eQuantum Ring&r is bound with a &cGold Dungeon Key&r - the Sun Spirit's due."
				"&c⚔&r &eSpatial Storage&r and every &eMEGA Cell&r are forged in &cVenus calorite&r."
				"&c⚔&r The &eDraconium Core&r is pinned with a &cSilver Dungeon Key&r - the Valkyrie Queen's due."
				"&c⚔&r &eFission Reactor Casings&r are forged around &cGold Dungeon Keys&r - the Sun Spirit guards your atom."
				""
				"&6&lTHE ENDING&r"
				"&c⚔&r The &bCelestial Core&r wants &cfour Aether dungeon keys&r - Slider, Valkyrie Queen, Sun Spirit, Eye of the Storm - plus the &cMonstrous Horn&r, a &cNether Star&r, and one ingot from &cevery planet&r. Keys are a single guaranteed drop from the boss that guards the dungeon."
				"&c⚔&r The &eHeart of the Sky&r takes that Core, &cfour Void Signal relics&r, and the remains of &cIgnis&r and the &cNetherite Monstrosity&r."
				"&8Twelve bosses. One ending."
				""
				"&aEverything up to the ME Controller you can build sitting on your island.&r &cNothing after it.&r"
				""
				"Every locked door tells you which key it wants. JEI shows every recipe. No guessing - just climbing."
			]
